WEBVTT

01:36.729 --> 01:39.960
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.100 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 11]

01:42.340 --> 01:44.620
I've seen many young people like you,

01:44.750 --> 01:46.550
full of passion and dreams.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.670
After scraping around for a few years,

01:49.700 --> 01:51.630
you'll end up with a broken heart

01:51.660 --> 01:53.860
and an empty wallet, slinking away in defeat.

01:58.240 --> 01:59.670
Some fail,

02:00.020 --> 02:01.660
but some succeed, right?

02:01.830 --> 02:04.010
How will I know whether I can make it or not if I don't try?

02:06.070 --> 02:06.780
Come on.

02:08.199 --> 02:09.000
Take a look at this.

02:09.900 --> 02:10.630
My resume.

02:10.259 --> 02:12.160
[Start-up Experience] [Language Ability]

02:14.330 --> 02:16.800
[Professional Skills] [Innovation Workshop]

02:16.750 --> 02:18.620
You created "Pet Home"?

02:21.890 --> 02:23.070
For real?

02:25.079 --> 02:26.650
[Pet Home: Raise Pets, Not Pests]

02:25.829 --> 02:26.960
Feel free to browse.

02:27.329 --> 02:29.480
The first pet supplies website in China.

02:29.510 --> 02:30.620
Fundraising went quite smoothly,

02:30.620 --> 02:31.990
but we burned through all the money in two years.

02:33.220 --> 02:34.520
Then we had to shut down.

02:34.720 --> 02:36.360
All my ideas after that

02:36.660 --> 02:38.079
were pretty much the same story.

02:40.890 --> 02:42.500
That's pretty unlucky for you.

02:42.540 --> 02:43.540
It's not just me who's unlucky.

02:43.800 --> 02:45.340
It's our whole batch of entrepreneurs.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.520
Not a single one of us succeeded.

02:46.970 --> 02:48.990
Some are now working in the internet industry,

02:49.050 --> 02:49.750
paying off debts.

02:49.780 --> 02:51.570
Some went back to their hometowns to open small restaurants to pay off debts.

02:51.890 --> 02:53.170
Some even took civil service exams.

02:53.530 --> 02:54.590
Starting from the bottom,

02:54.630 --> 02:56.600
they're probably section chiefs by now.

02:57.050 --> 02:58.120
Let me tell you,

02:58.320 --> 03:00.670
back then, we were all graduates from top universities.

03:00.700 --> 03:02.050
We all went to Project 985 Universities,

03:02.080 --> 03:04.400
and we all thought we could change the world.

03:09.750 --> 03:11.440
After failing so many times,

03:11.490 --> 03:13.200
you must have accumulated some experience and learned some lessons, right?

03:32.670 --> 03:34.010
Last year alone,

03:35.130 --> 03:37.050
more than 7 million people tried to start an internet business.

03:37.160 --> 03:39.760
How many projects do you think successfully got investment?

03:39.790 --> 03:41.190
And how many successfully got listed on NASDAQ

03:41.190 --> 03:43.150
from 1999 until now?

03:44.620 --> 03:45.970
The odds of success in this

03:46.180 --> 03:47.600
are even lower than winning the lottery.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.730
If you're from a wealthy family,

03:53.930 --> 03:54.829
you can use some spare cash

03:54.850 --> 03:56.220
to burn and play around, that's fine.

03:56.690 --> 03:57.790
If you don't have money,

03:57.810 --> 03:58.880
then you rely on connections.

03:58.920 --> 04:00.470
If you don't even have connections,

04:00.490 --> 04:01.800
and the only things you have are passion

04:01.820 --> 04:03.510
and some creative ideas,

04:03.580 --> 04:04.610
don't bother.

04:04.640 --> 04:05.810
Don't waste your youth on this.

04:10.740 --> 04:12.420
Granny Ma had a stroke and has been hospitalized.

04:12.440 --> 04:13.770
When are you coming back?

04:15.750 --> 04:17.810
Why no reply? Did you get the message?

04:19.950 --> 04:21.160
I'll head back right away.

04:37.070 --> 04:37.690
Bro.

04:38.950 --> 04:41.659
I'm thinking of creating an online smart question bank.

04:41.740 --> 04:43.150
Do you think it has a chance?

04:47.760 --> 04:48.850
Watch carefully.

04:50.470 --> 04:51.150
See this?

04:53.500 --> 04:55.270
This was made by one of my juniors.

04:54.100 --> 04:57.010
[Smart Question Bank]

04:56.010 --> 04:58.780
He graduated from MIT two years ago and came back to start a business.

04:59.530 --> 05:01.250
This homepage was created by him.

05:02.190 --> 05:04.790
This is the remnant of his entrepreneurial failure.

05:13.780 --> 05:14.690
Wait!

05:15.180 --> 05:16.280
Bus!

05:18.110 --> 05:19.060
Wait!

05:23.700 --> 05:24.540
Wait!

05:33.530 --> 05:35.240
Are you deaf?

05:55.770 --> 06:00.470
[Beijing Olympics: One World, One Dream]

05:57.360 --> 06:00.140
♫My door is always open♫

05:59.150 --> 06:01.470
With the rapid development of information technology,

06:00.310 --> 06:03.080
♫Accepting the world♫

06:01.470 --> 06:02.390
for the Chinese internet industry,

06:02.460 --> 06:04.400
the year 2007

06:03.710 --> 06:06.120
♫After our embrace comes our mutual understanding♫

06:04.510 --> 06:06.740
is undoubtedly a milestone.

06:06.370 --> 06:09.240
♫You'll fall in love with this place♫

06:06.910 --> 06:08.720
This year, the number of internet users in China

06:08.720 --> 06:09.900
reached 210 million,

06:09.990 --> 06:12.550
with an annual growth rate of 53.3%.

06:10.060 --> 06:12.160
♫Friends from far and near♫

06:12.830 --> 06:14.830
This figure not only caught the world's attention,

06:13.010 --> 06:15.220
♫Please don't be shy♫

06:14.900 --> 06:15.990
but also marked China's

06:15.440 --> 06:18.210
♫May you come back again♫

06:15.990 --> 06:18.590
official entry into the ranks of major internet powers.

06:18.740 --> 06:22.380
♫We will always welcome you♫

06:21.260 --> 06:22.250
-Be careful.
-One step at a time.

06:22.740 --> 06:23.390
Nice.

06:23.990 --> 06:25.390
Nice!

06:25.390 --> 06:26.470
Well done.

06:26.470 --> 06:27.470
Take your time and try again.

06:27.470 --> 06:28.910
Take it slow. Don't rush it.

06:28.990 --> 06:30.670
This is a small step for Granny Ma,

06:30.670 --> 06:33.150
but a giant leap for our entire courtyard.

06:33.170 --> 06:33.700
That's right.

06:33.730 --> 06:34.970
He really has a way with words.

06:35.020 --> 06:37.000
The way those who've seen the world

06:37.020 --> 06:38.340
speak is just different.

06:38.370 --> 06:39.640
You should learn from him.

06:39.670 --> 06:40.470
I... I...

06:40.470 --> 06:41.750
I've seen the world too.

06:41.790 --> 06:43.110
I just can't express it like that.

06:43.830 --> 06:44.770
Come on. Keep walking.

06:44.790 --> 06:45.750
Keep walking.

06:47.620 --> 06:48.700
Come on, come on.

06:52.930 --> 06:54.110
What you just said,

06:54.110 --> 06:55.920
something about a small step and a giant leap,

06:56.110 --> 06:57.240
I remember those words.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.240
I've seen them in the public toilet.

06:58.240 --> 06:58.790
Happy now?

07:00.410 --> 07:02.920
From now on, let your grandma work less.

07:03.080 --> 07:05.090
If you need anything, just tell me.

07:05.320 --> 07:06.180
I know.

07:07.670 --> 07:08.630
We can't rush this.

07:08.640 --> 07:09.310
Right.

07:09.310 --> 07:09.910
We can't rush it.

07:09.910 --> 07:10.750
There's no rush.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.230
Mr. Shao, this is for you.

07:12.230 --> 07:13.480
Grandma, let me give you a massage.

07:14.150 --> 07:14.940
Try walking.

07:18.480 --> 07:19.310
Granny!

07:20.100 --> 07:20.910
Granny!

07:21.710 --> 07:22.500
Granny.

07:23.790 --> 07:24.800
Are you alright?

07:25.750 --> 07:27.720
You little rascal.

07:27.990 --> 07:29.790
So you finally decided to come back, huh?

07:31.360 --> 07:32.710
You're getting bolder and bolder these days.

07:32.750 --> 07:34.500
Running off so far without a word.

07:34.630 --> 07:36.180
We were so worried.

07:36.310 --> 07:37.030
I'm sorry.

07:37.060 --> 07:38.320
I won't dare to do it again.

07:38.550 --> 07:39.310
Granny.

07:39.740 --> 07:41.080
I'm just glad you're okay.

07:41.310 --> 07:42.890
I was so worried about you all the way here.

07:43.430 --> 07:44.470
I'm alright.

07:44.500 --> 07:45.070
Look.

07:45.190 --> 07:47.280
I'm standing here just fine, aren't I?

07:47.750 --> 07:48.310
Okay.

07:50.130 --> 07:51.159
Let me tell you,

07:51.960 --> 07:53.550
you're definitely going to

07:53.670 --> 07:54.680
get a beating.

07:54.680 --> 07:55.560
You won't get away with that.

07:55.909 --> 07:57.159
I'll head back home then, Granny.

07:57.550 --> 07:58.240
Be careful.

07:58.430 --> 07:59.270
See you, Granny.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.860
Rest early.

08:03.750 --> 08:04.310
Mom.

08:05.310 --> 08:05.830
Mom.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.390
He'll definitely get a good beating.

08:07.430 --> 08:07.950
Mom.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.360
I'm back.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.430
Don't be angry. Don't be angry.

08:14.140 --> 08:15.590
It's good that he's back.

08:17.430 --> 08:17.950
Mom.

08:17.990 --> 08:19.080
Why are you hanging it up?

08:24.640 --> 08:25.990
What can you possibly do?

08:26.090 --> 08:27.920
What should you be doing at your age?

08:27.990 --> 08:28.910
Studying.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.470
Look at you. You always

08:30.470 --> 08:31.430
act on every whim.

08:31.470 --> 08:32.230
You just left like that.

08:32.230 --> 08:33.669
It makes me angry just talking about it.

08:34.010 --> 08:34.470
Right,

08:34.470 --> 08:36.090
our family isn't well-off,

08:36.270 --> 08:38.390
but your father and I can figure something out.

08:38.480 --> 08:40.480
It's not your time to earn money now.

08:40.510 --> 08:42.179
Don't you understand, Son?

08:42.549 --> 08:44.169
But when my dad was my age,

08:44.270 --> 08:46.270
he was already fishing in the river to help support the family.

08:46.270 --> 08:47.260
That was a totally different era, okay?

08:47.550 --> 08:48.470
Back then,

08:48.470 --> 08:50.320
how many high school graduates were there in the whole country?

08:51.020 --> 08:51.800
What about now?

08:52.140 --> 08:53.420
Someone like you

08:53.590 --> 08:56.190
wouldn't even be qualified to be a security guard at a factory.

08:59.550 --> 09:00.870
-Mr. Xu, you…
-Mr. Xu?

09:01.030 --> 09:01.870
What brings you here?

09:01.910 --> 09:03.190
Come on in. Come on in.

09:03.370 --> 09:04.590
Wanghe, you're back.

09:05.430 --> 09:06.310
Hurry up and make some tea.

09:07.200 --> 09:08.110
Please, have a seat.

09:08.130 --> 09:09.280
Mr. Xu, please have a seat.

09:09.680 --> 09:10.120
Alright.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.440
Please, sit.

09:16.920 --> 09:18.160
Is his leave request ready?

09:18.580 --> 09:19.660
Yes, it is.

09:20.680 --> 09:23.280
Wanghe went to Beijing to see an exhibition this time.

09:23.510 --> 09:25.250
He didn't even inform you teachers.

09:25.390 --> 09:26.700
Please excuse him.

09:27.030 --> 09:28.230
-I'll go...
-What exhibition?

09:29.280 --> 09:31.670
I went to Beijing to rent servers.

09:47.710 --> 09:48.510
Mr. Xu.

09:49.920 --> 09:50.720
Thank you.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.500
Thank you.

09:52.010 --> 09:53.170
Wanghe's mom, please sit.

09:54.450 --> 09:55.340
Wanghe, you sit too.

09:55.390 --> 09:56.190
Sit, sit.

09:59.390 --> 10:00.630
Wanghe's mom.

10:00.650 --> 10:01.950
The reason I came here

10:01.990 --> 10:03.030
is to have a good talk

10:03.030 --> 10:04.120
with you parents.

10:04.140 --> 10:06.500
I want to know your honest thoughts.

10:06.530 --> 10:08.210
Feel free to say anything.

10:08.450 --> 10:10.020
There's no need to hold back.

10:10.860 --> 10:12.600
Sure. No problem.

10:13.140 --> 10:16.010
This kid has been willful and disobedient since he was little.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.610
It's all my fault. I've spoiled him.

10:18.070 --> 10:20.340
This time, he skipped school to go to Beijing

10:20.380 --> 10:21.910
without telling either of us.

10:22.180 --> 10:24.670
His father and I were both furious about it.

10:24.950 --> 10:25.480
Right.

10:26.100 --> 10:27.470
The principal was furious too.

10:28.110 --> 10:30.140
But we all know Wanghe is a good kid.

10:30.500 --> 10:31.700
If it were someone else,

10:31.720 --> 10:33.830
the punishment would at least be a warning.

10:34.350 --> 10:35.220
Wait.

10:36.130 --> 10:37.570
Are you saying

10:37.590 --> 10:38.770
this time,

10:39.480 --> 10:40.580
there won't be any punishment?

10:42.810 --> 10:44.190
Are... Are you serious?

10:45.460 --> 10:46.750
Great! Many thanks to the principal.

10:46.750 --> 10:47.830
Thank you, thank you.

10:47.870 --> 10:48.750
Come on, say thank you to your teacher.

10:48.750 --> 10:50.230
I traded my business plan for this.

10:50.230 --> 10:51.790
What plan could you possibly have?

10:54.340 --> 10:55.390
Thank you.

10:55.770 --> 10:56.850
It's nothing.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.880
Wanghe is very smart.

10:59.470 --> 11:00.620
It's just he prefers certain subjects over the others.

11:01.030 --> 11:03.280
When he treats math, physics, and chemistry exams seriously,

11:03.310 --> 11:04.870
he gets pretty good grades.

11:05.020 --> 11:07.350
It's just his Chinese grades are a bit unsatisfactory.

11:07.830 --> 11:08.800
I think

11:08.950 --> 11:11.040
if Wanghe starts working hard

11:11.200 --> 11:11.950
from now on

11:11.950 --> 11:12.550
and makes a final sprint,

11:12.810 --> 11:15.250
it's not impossible for him to get into university.

11:17.040 --> 11:17.950
Really?

11:17.950 --> 11:19.310
Mom, don't listen to his nonsense.

11:19.310 --> 11:20.150
Shut up.

11:21.670 --> 11:23.480
Mr. Xu, please continue.

11:23.930 --> 11:24.850
Once,

11:24.890 --> 11:26.430
Wanghe fell asleep in class.

11:26.450 --> 11:27.450
I scolded him,

11:27.640 --> 11:29.490
saying "Rotten wood cannot be carved."

11:31.670 --> 11:32.420
"Rotten wood"

11:33.020 --> 11:34.100
means deadwood.

11:34.130 --> 11:35.300
It's useless.

11:36.680 --> 11:37.850
This is what Confucius

11:37.880 --> 11:39.290
said to his student Zai Yu when he scolded him.

11:39.310 --> 11:40.540
It's a famous quote.

11:40.580 --> 11:41.940
The main point was to express his anger at the student's lack of effort,

11:42.190 --> 11:44.830
hoping he could put his mind on the right things.

11:47.110 --> 11:47.870
As soon as I finished speaking,

11:47.870 --> 11:49.110
Wanghe

11:49.470 --> 11:50.550
raised his hand and stood up.

11:51.110 --> 11:53.350
He gave me a long speech,

11:53.350 --> 11:54.590
providing examples to explain

11:54.590 --> 11:55.980
that even rotten wood

11:56.070 --> 11:58.710
has its own value and uses.

11:59.110 --> 12:00.390
He gave more than ten examples.

12:00.720 --> 12:02.070
When I heard that,

12:02.480 --> 12:03.360
I realized each example

12:03.360 --> 12:05.470
could develop into an industry.

12:06.180 --> 12:08.070
Many of his classmates were stunned.

12:09.710 --> 12:11.660
Just wait until your father gets home.

12:12.600 --> 12:14.770
Wanghe's mom, the reason I'm telling you this

12:14.990 --> 12:16.520
is to let you know that

12:16.710 --> 12:19.150
I believe Wanghe is very talented.

12:19.590 --> 12:21.230
As long as he starts working hard now,

12:21.310 --> 12:22.510
it's not too late for everything.

12:23.180 --> 12:23.790
I mean it.

12:34.550 --> 12:35.310
What?

12:36.070 --> 12:37.740
You don't have confidence in yourself?

12:44.550 --> 12:45.310
Do you know

12:45.550 --> 12:46.430
Google?

12:47.480 --> 12:48.430
Yes, I do.

12:48.830 --> 12:50.830
The best search engine in the world.

12:50.830 --> 12:52.460
When Google started,

12:52.460 --> 12:54.310
Yahoo was already there,

12:54.310 --> 12:56.430
which was the world's number one search engine,

12:56.450 --> 12:57.970
an internet giant.

12:58.790 --> 13:01.070
Even Silicon Valley investors tried to dissuade Google,

13:01.070 --> 13:02.630
saying that with Yahoo ahead,

13:02.630 --> 13:04.030
they'd have no future.

13:05.370 --> 13:06.930
But they didn't give up.

13:07.550 --> 13:09.070
They persevered in the search engine field

13:09.110 --> 13:11.030
and carved out their own space.

13:11.430 --> 13:12.040
Let me ask you,

13:12.770 --> 13:13.970
what was the key

13:14.590 --> 13:15.580
to their success?

13:16.110 --> 13:17.320
Technology, I guess.

13:17.350 --> 13:19.020
And what's the source of technology?

13:22.150 --> 13:22.940
Knowledge.

13:23.280 --> 13:24.250
And

13:25.140 --> 13:26.660
deep thinking.

13:28.460 --> 13:29.750
In terms of mere knowledge,

13:29.790 --> 13:31.600
I believe with your IQ,

13:31.630 --> 13:32.750
even if you study at home,

13:33.590 --> 13:35.020
you can still manage.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.800
But systematic learning

13:36.830 --> 13:38.830
can help you establish

13:39.340 --> 13:42.210
a scientific and effective thinking framework in the shortest time.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.450
It's like the foundation.

13:44.990 --> 13:47.050
How tall a building can be

13:47.340 --> 13:50.330
depends on how deep its foundation is,

13:50.460 --> 13:51.060
right?

13:52.150 --> 13:52.980
Last time,

13:53.900 --> 13:55.730
you mentioned that ebony wood

13:55.980 --> 13:57.180
is priceless.

13:57.380 --> 13:58.240
It was a great point.

13:58.940 --> 14:00.380
But have you thought about this?

14:00.400 --> 14:03.770
For a tree to become ebony wood,

14:03.800 --> 14:06.220
it's not just about the passage of time.

14:07.230 --> 14:09.820
First, it has to be a tree,

14:09.840 --> 14:11.490
and it has to grow well.

14:13.810 --> 14:15.470
If it were green foxtail,

14:15.480 --> 14:18.050
even after thousands of years,

14:18.350 --> 14:19.950
it still wouldn't become ebony wood.

14:20.520 --> 14:20.970
Right?

14:26.800 --> 14:27.910
Mr. Xu, this...

14:27.950 --> 14:28.830
This is great.

14:28.850 --> 14:30.690
Did you hear that?

14:30.750 --> 14:32.020
Mr. Xu was praising you,

14:32.300 --> 14:33.300
saying you're promising.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.850
Mr. Xu.

14:36.990 --> 14:37.950
Did you hear that?

14:37.970 --> 14:39.450
You must study hard.

14:39.490 --> 14:40.660
If you don't study well,

14:40.930 --> 14:42.130
your dad and I will beat you up together.

14:44.910 --> 14:46.100
Mr... Mr. Xu.

14:46.130 --> 14:49.370
Please take extra care of him at school.

14:55.950 --> 14:56.480
Alright.

14:57.430 --> 14:59.550
I'll also count on you, Wanghe's mom.

14:59.810 --> 15:01.630
After all, with the support of parents,

15:01.650 --> 15:03.000
we teachers

15:03.350 --> 15:05.630
can do more with less,

15:05.660 --> 15:06.350
right?

15:06.370 --> 15:07.130
Sure. Sure.

15:07.240 --> 15:09.920
P-Please take extra care of him.

15:10.150 --> 15:11.110
Well,

15:11.150 --> 15:13.390
since we're not at school after all,

15:13.390 --> 15:15.170
we don't know what's going on in there.

15:15.740 --> 15:18.270
If he misbehaves at school,

15:18.350 --> 15:19.750
just discipline him as needed.

15:19.790 --> 15:20.950
His father and I

15:20.980 --> 15:21.820
don't mind.

15:22.040 --> 15:23.370
But Mr. Xu does.

15:24.850 --> 15:26.490
Alright, I'll be on my way.

15:26.850 --> 15:27.360
Alright.

15:27.670 --> 15:29.020
Thank you for everything.

15:29.290 --> 15:30.390
Goodbye, Mr. Xu.

15:30.420 --> 15:31.520
Alright, goodbye.

15:36.400 --> 15:37.600
I won't hit you,

15:38.830 --> 15:39.860
but with your father's temper,

15:39.900 --> 15:41.020
you better think about what to do.

15:56.990 --> 15:57.750
Mr. Xu has left?

15:57.770 --> 15:58.450
Yes.

15:58.550 --> 15:59.520
How was it?

15:59.640 --> 16:00.820
Are you two alright?

16:00.850 --> 16:02.740
You owe us both a beating.

16:03.640 --> 16:04.670
How was Beijing?

16:05.430 --> 16:06.250
It was alright.

16:06.270 --> 16:07.440
Did you go to Zhongguancun?

16:08.070 --> 16:08.790
I did.

16:08.820 --> 16:10.130
It's not quite what I imagined.

16:10.290 --> 16:11.620
Don't leave already.

16:11.650 --> 16:12.530
Tell us about it.

16:12.990 --> 16:13.910
How's it different from your imagination?

16:19.260 --> 16:21.010
Before going to Beijing,

16:21.750 --> 16:23.210
I thought I was smarter than everyone else.

16:23.860 --> 16:25.200
I thought I could see further into the future than anyone.

16:25.470 --> 16:26.860
But after I got there, I realized

16:26.890 --> 16:28.290
there are too many smart people.

16:28.540 --> 16:29.890
Taking a stroll around Zhongguancun,

16:30.560 --> 16:31.470
I saw graduates

16:31.590 --> 16:33.340
from top universities across the country

16:33.450 --> 16:34.880
all struggling

16:34.900 --> 16:35.620
and working hard.

16:36.810 --> 16:38.510
Everyone already knows

16:38.530 --> 16:39.260
those little tricks I learned online,

16:39.780 --> 16:41.230
and they're already putting them into practice.

16:42.570 --> 16:44.120
Only after going there did I realize

16:44.640 --> 16:46.810
I was just like a frog in a well.

16:47.150 --> 16:48.520
So what are you thinking now?

16:49.500 --> 16:50.260
I haven't figured it out yet.

16:53.000 --> 16:53.970
I think

16:54.230 --> 16:55.640
maybe you should give it a shot

16:55.660 --> 16:57.280
and try to get into university.

16:57.530 --> 16:58.810
Even if it's not for your parents,

16:58.830 --> 17:00.450
you'll have more options in the future.

17:00.620 --> 17:01.270
That's right.

17:02.800 --> 17:03.790
With your brains,

17:03.810 --> 17:04.859
if you really work hard for the exam,

17:04.960 --> 17:06.170
you could at least get into a second-tier university.

17:07.790 --> 17:09.780
Is it a matter of taking the exam or not?

17:10.099 --> 17:11.630
Given my family's situation,

17:11.960 --> 17:13.130
and Siyi...

17:13.500 --> 17:15.910
Siyi is going to try to get enrolled in a normal university, which is tuition-free.

17:16.150 --> 17:17.310
Your dad should be able to make some money

17:17.329 --> 17:18.740
from selling the ship.

17:23.829 --> 17:25.560
When our parents tell us

17:25.589 --> 17:26.829
they're doing things for our own good,

17:26.859 --> 17:27.869
isn't it really annoying?

17:28.150 --> 17:29.380
It's the same the other way around.

17:29.430 --> 17:30.480
When you do things for your parents' good,

17:30.500 --> 17:31.720
don't they get annoyed too?

17:31.750 --> 17:32.700
They do.

17:33.660 --> 17:35.190
Don't take this the wrong way,

17:35.510 --> 17:36.430
but what you're doing

17:36.800 --> 17:38.410
is called emotional blackmail.

18:26.460 --> 18:28.400
Why are you wearing so much in this weather?

18:28.470 --> 18:29.620
Are you going to the North Pole or what?

18:32.040 --> 18:34.410
Wanghe is definitely going to get a beating tonight.

18:35.700 --> 18:37.140
Your Uncle Xie said

18:37.320 --> 18:38.920
he wanted to teach him a lesson.

18:39.340 --> 18:40.640
I have to try to stop it a bit,

18:40.670 --> 18:42.290
right? We can't let the kid get hurt too badly.

18:43.960 --> 18:45.280
He won't.

18:45.320 --> 18:47.520
Do you think Wanghe is the type to take a beating quietly?

18:47.790 --> 18:49.160
If it really hurts,

18:49.180 --> 18:50.310
he'll beg for mercy.

18:50.430 --> 18:51.440
There are things you don't know.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.040
Your Uncle Xie has been

18:53.320 --> 18:54.810
in a bad mood lately.

18:55.130 --> 18:57.750
I'm worried he might not stop once he starts beating him,

18:58.030 --> 18:58.840
unable to control himself.

18:58.860 --> 18:59.810
He's in a bad mood?

19:02.740 --> 19:03.920
Are you really going to sell the ship?

19:05.600 --> 19:06.550
How do you know?

19:07.510 --> 19:08.610
My mom told me.

19:09.030 --> 19:10.230
Has Uncle Xie agreed?

19:15.100 --> 19:17.000
Business hasn't been good lately.

19:18.930 --> 19:20.640
After selling the ship, we'll see if we can

19:20.660 --> 19:21.910
find something else to do.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.390
Besides seafaring,

19:23.490 --> 19:24.370
what else can you do?

19:25.490 --> 19:26.420
Why would you say that?

19:26.460 --> 19:28.370
You're looking down on me, aren't you?

19:28.770 --> 19:29.890
Let me tell you,

19:30.310 --> 19:33.360
Fenghua, back in the day, your Uncle Xie and I

19:33.390 --> 19:35.050
traveled all over the country.

19:35.070 --> 19:36.210
We've done so many businesses,

19:36.230 --> 19:37.960
like electronic watches and foreign cigarettes.

19:37.990 --> 19:39.170
You don't know how many of those we bought and resold.

19:39.450 --> 19:40.390
We even ran a video hall once,

19:40.470 --> 19:42.630
showing Hong Kong and Taiwan films, action movies, and romance movies.

19:42.670 --> 19:43.990
Your mom loved watching those the most.

19:44.190 --> 19:45.280
What nonsense are you talking about?

19:45.970 --> 19:48.220
It was "The Legend of the Condor Heroes", right?

19:48.800 --> 19:50.950
We did whatever was profitable back then.

19:52.660 --> 19:53.990
So why can't you do it now?

19:56.620 --> 19:57.270
Well...

19:58.090 --> 19:59.980
It's not that we can't do it now.

20:00.400 --> 20:03.660
But after all, times have changed.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.780
right?

20:05.230 --> 20:07.350
We need to find a new way to make a living.

20:09.010 --> 20:11.350
In recent years, so many people lost their jobs,

20:11.820 --> 20:13.260
but I haven't seen anyone starve to death.

20:21.790 --> 20:22.710
Dad.

20:23.180 --> 20:24.540
I actually have an idea.

20:24.570 --> 20:25.570
You don't have to sell the ship.

20:26.470 --> 20:27.250
Really?

20:29.310 --> 20:31.160
If this idea can be implemented,

20:31.190 --> 20:32.920
Uncle Xie won't feel so bad anymore,

20:32.950 --> 20:34.750
and Wanghe might be able to avoid this beating.

20:41.750 --> 20:46.170
♫Girl, you sit on the bow♫

20:46.200 --> 20:49.530
♫I tow the boat on the shore♫

20:50.870 --> 20:55.160
♫In deep love♫

20:56.280 --> 20:56.810
Bro.

20:58.140 --> 20:59.010
You went drinking again.

20:59.560 --> 21:00.340
Lao'er.

21:00.390 --> 21:01.240
You're still up?

21:01.260 --> 21:02.430
Yeah.

21:02.460 --> 21:05.430
There's something I want to discuss with you.

21:07.730 --> 21:08.330
Be careful.

21:08.420 --> 21:09.100
Alright.

21:09.470 --> 21:10.090
Go ahead.

21:11.800 --> 21:13.310
Here's the thing.

21:13.410 --> 21:14.630
It's my daughter's idea.

21:14.650 --> 21:16.250
A floating supermarket.

21:17.420 --> 21:19.070
That is to say, we stock up on goods

21:19.110 --> 21:20.430
and sell them on the ship.

21:20.590 --> 21:21.740
We can make extra money

21:21.770 --> 21:22.790
while seafaring.

21:22.810 --> 21:24.250
It'll be killing two birds with one stone, right?

21:24.280 --> 21:26.590
Let me finish, bro.

21:27.140 --> 21:29.170
Tell me, how many seafaring ships

21:29.530 --> 21:31.150
are there on the river now?

21:31.550 --> 21:32.850
Talking about setting up a floating supermarket.

21:32.900 --> 21:34.680
Who are you going to sell the goods to?

21:34.710 --> 21:37.380
You'd be better off setting up a roasted sweet potato stand by the roadside.

21:37.410 --> 21:38.690
It would be more profitable than this.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.950
It's not like that, bro.

21:41.710 --> 21:42.440
About this matter,

21:42.480 --> 21:45.670
Yan also thinks we could give it a try.

21:46.260 --> 21:47.370
You're listening to

21:47.410 --> 21:48.360
women's opinions now?

21:52.430 --> 21:53.470
Don't worry.

21:53.990 --> 21:56.760
Even if we can't do seafaring business anymore,

21:56.800 --> 21:57.930
as long as you stick with me,

21:58.710 --> 21:59.820
you won't be poor.

22:09.510 --> 22:10.280
How did it go?

22:13.100 --> 22:14.150
He didn't agree?

22:14.870 --> 22:16.790
I'll talk to him again later.

22:16.910 --> 22:18.230
How about we ask Wanghe to talk to him?

22:18.490 --> 22:19.460
He's quick-witted.

22:19.500 --> 22:20.260
When it comes to making money,

22:20.280 --> 22:21.410
I think Uncle Xie will listen to him.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.530
Why bother talking to him?

22:22.860 --> 22:25.560
He used to make the call on everything on the ship,

22:25.600 --> 22:27.800
and now we still have to listen to him about opening the supermarket or not?

22:27.820 --> 22:28.820
It's none of his business!

22:29.380 --> 22:31.220
We're so poor that we can barely put food on the table.

22:31.240 --> 22:32.210
If we still don't have any income in the near future,

22:32.240 --> 22:33.750
the whole family will be left with nothing to eat.

22:34.780 --> 22:35.780
What's wrong with you?

22:35.800 --> 22:36.610
Why are you saying these things

22:36.630 --> 22:37.670
in front of our daughter?

22:37.710 --> 22:39.750
You're just too easily swayed.

22:39.940 --> 22:41.750
You're a grown man, yet you don't have your own opinions.

22:41.780 --> 22:43.180
You always listen to Boss Xie on everything.

22:43.210 --> 22:44.190
Who's listening to him?

22:44.380 --> 22:45.670
You just won't let it go, will you?

22:59.190 --> 23:00.990
This is ridiculous.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.390
Don't go in yet.

23:03.390 --> 23:04.270
I have something to ask you.

23:04.270 --> 23:06.730
Wait until I'm done beating him up.

23:06.760 --> 23:08.670
You're not listening to me anymore, are you?

23:09.370 --> 23:10.900
Wanghe mentioned his idea of dropping out of school

23:11.340 --> 23:12.880
to you before, right?

23:13.040 --> 23:14.430
He mentioned it briefly.

23:14.570 --> 23:16.220
Why didn't you tell me about it?

23:16.560 --> 23:17.030
Well,

23:17.030 --> 23:19.190
I didn't expect him to just

23:19.190 --> 23:19.990
go through with it.

23:20.630 --> 23:21.610
Wanghe said

23:22.080 --> 23:23.810
you didn't object at the time.

23:23.830 --> 23:24.550
Is that true?

23:25.710 --> 23:27.240
But I didn't agree either.

23:27.270 --> 23:28.710
What kind of talk is that?

23:28.890 --> 23:30.890
Xie Tiancheng, what were you thinking?

23:30.910 --> 23:31.840
Are your brains damaged from all the drinking?

23:32.100 --> 23:33.790
It's his last year of senior high.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.240
You can't wait for such a short time?

23:35.240 --> 23:36.430
You even said we were both useless,

23:36.450 --> 23:37.630
and we'd need our son to provide for us.

23:37.660 --> 23:38.890
What were you thinking?

23:38.910 --> 23:40.260
What kind of talk is that?

23:40.290 --> 23:41.470
What are you talking about?

23:41.470 --> 23:42.230
This... You...

23:42.230 --> 23:42.910
Let me beat him first.

23:42.950 --> 23:43.630
Don't beat him.

23:43.630 --> 23:44.950
Beat me instead.

23:44.950 --> 23:45.630
I deserve to be beaten.

23:45.630 --> 23:45.950
What are you doing?

23:45.950 --> 23:46.710
I don't earn money,

23:46.710 --> 23:47.910
and I failed to raise our son well,

23:47.950 --> 23:49.230
making him worry about the family.

23:49.230 --> 23:50.110
Beat me. Beat me.

23:50.130 --> 23:51.150
Just beat me to death.

23:51.200 --> 23:51.830
Dad!

23:53.120 --> 23:53.800
Mom!

23:56.350 --> 23:57.030
I'm sorry.

23:57.550 --> 23:58.270
I was wrong.

24:01.500 --> 24:02.380
I was wrong!

24:07.380 --> 24:09.060
What are you doing?

24:11.730 --> 24:13.030
Get... Get ready.

24:13.050 --> 24:13.830
If you

24:14.790 --> 24:17.410
truly realize your mistake,

24:17.990 --> 24:20.850
make up for the time lost.

24:21.510 --> 24:25.870
Don't make your mother worried and angry anymore in the future.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.490
Dad.

24:43.100 --> 24:43.940
Aren't you warm?

24:44.850 --> 24:45.570
I am. I am.

24:46.670 --> 24:47.480
Let's go.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.590
Haihong.

25:51.610 --> 25:52.750
Why did you get up so late?

25:52.790 --> 25:53.950
Do you know what time it is?

25:56.270 --> 25:57.050
Yan.

26:00.450 --> 26:01.980
I have something to tell you.

26:02.010 --> 26:02.760
Go ahead.

26:02.870 --> 26:04.960
I don't want to run my stall anymore.

26:06.910 --> 26:08.010
Why?

26:08.990 --> 26:10.960
There are too few customers, so I can't make enough money.

26:11.390 --> 26:12.260
I want to get a driver's license

26:12.290 --> 26:13.140
and go drive a truck.

26:13.940 --> 26:15.030
Are you out of your mind?

26:15.120 --> 26:17.140
Is truck driving a job for women?

26:18.650 --> 26:19.720
I've asked around.

26:19.760 --> 26:22.360
Zhang who lives at Flower Street has a truck.

26:22.400 --> 26:23.950
He's sick and can't drive long distances anymore,

26:23.970 --> 26:25.970
so he rented his truck to a transport company.

26:26.230 --> 26:27.610
He complains that the rent is too low.

26:27.640 --> 26:28.920
I've talked to him,

26:29.010 --> 26:31.580
and once I get my driver's license, I'll rent his truck.

26:31.650 --> 26:35.120
I'll rent his first, then buy my own after I've made enough money.

26:35.370 --> 26:36.840
This is no small matter.

26:36.880 --> 26:39.040
Have you discussed this with your husband?

26:41.640 --> 26:42.870
I'm not discussing it with him.

26:43.030 --> 26:46.050
He won't agree to this kind of thing.

26:47.390 --> 26:48.570
I'll get the license first.

26:48.600 --> 26:50.480
And once I start driving and making money,

26:50.620 --> 26:53.040
it'll be too late for him to object.

26:54.230 --> 26:55.870
As long as it's your decision,

26:56.170 --> 26:57.210
I'll support you.

26:58.860 --> 26:59.490
Oh, right.

26:59.600 --> 27:01.510
Don't worry about Wanghe's meals.

27:01.530 --> 27:02.140
I'll take care of them.

27:04.550 --> 27:05.390
Then I...

27:05.550 --> 27:06.740
I'll thank you in advance.

27:06.760 --> 27:07.210
Don't worry.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.400
Also, one more thing.

27:09.900 --> 27:12.270
Don't tell anyone about this for now.

27:12.420 --> 27:13.270
Understood.

27:14.550 --> 27:15.270
I'm off.

27:17.660 --> 27:18.390
Oh, right.

27:18.550 --> 27:19.580
Haihong.

27:20.110 --> 27:23.140
There's something I want to tell you too.

27:23.170 --> 27:23.930
Well,

27:24.570 --> 27:26.640
I've discussed with my husband Maotian,

27:26.670 --> 27:29.530
and we're planning to open a floating supermarket.

27:31.830 --> 27:32.970
Can you make money from that?

27:32.990 --> 27:34.540
Fenghua looked it up online.

27:34.570 --> 27:35.680
It should work.

27:35.970 --> 27:37.770
It's just we'll have to work harder.

27:37.790 --> 27:39.310
We'll have to work from dawn to dusk.

27:39.760 --> 27:40.910
As long as you can make money,

27:40.990 --> 27:42.030
a little hardship is fine.

27:42.060 --> 27:42.650
Just do it.

27:44.340 --> 27:46.080
We've got plenty of strength, right?

27:46.120 --> 27:46.650
I'm off.

28:18.650 --> 28:19.580
Let me try one.

28:21.230 --> 28:22.460
Be careful.

28:23.940 --> 28:24.980
Be careful. It's very hot.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.400
Look how greedy you are.

28:30.520 --> 28:32.220
Not bad, Siyi.

28:32.670 --> 28:34.980
Your skills are almost as good as Granny Ma's.

28:35.760 --> 28:37.410
Mom, can you teach me too?

28:37.430 --> 28:39.730
Whenever you do anything, I'll have to clean up after you.

28:39.950 --> 28:40.550
Good morning, Granny.

28:40.570 --> 28:41.140
Good morning, Granny.

28:41.190 --> 28:41.750
Good morning, aunties.

28:41.770 --> 28:42.590
Good morning, aunties.

28:42.750 --> 28:44.030
-Morning, Granny.
-They're all here.

28:44.060 --> 28:46.010
Xingchi, can't you behave yourself?

28:46.170 --> 28:46.810
Come and taste this.

28:46.830 --> 28:47.450
-Have a taste.
-Okay.

28:47.810 --> 28:49.200
Come on.

28:49.460 --> 28:50.330
You even know how to make this?

28:51.900 --> 28:52.710
Not bad.

28:52.710 --> 28:54.060
It looks pretty good.

28:54.090 --> 28:55.180
And it's delicious.

28:55.220 --> 28:55.910
It's delicious.

28:55.930 --> 28:56.610
One more.

28:58.280 --> 28:59.240
Amazing.

28:59.120 --> 29:00.690
[Breakfast]

28:59.260 --> 29:00.150
Not bad, right?

29:01.190 --> 29:02.340
Don't get cocky.

29:02.720 --> 29:04.920
Fried radish cakes are so simple to make.

29:04.950 --> 29:06.130
By the time you learn how to make

29:06.160 --> 29:07.990
our Ma family's braised meat,

29:08.030 --> 29:09.470
that's when you'll have real skills.

29:09.670 --> 29:10.310
Count me in.

29:10.350 --> 29:10.950
I want to learn it.

29:10.950 --> 29:11.430
Well,

29:11.460 --> 29:13.390
after I learn it, I'll be your assistant.

29:13.480 --> 29:14.020
Really?

29:14.020 --> 29:15.400
Are you up for it?

29:15.850 --> 29:16.190
[Breakfast]

29:15.870 --> 29:16.950
Let me tell you.

29:16.660 --> 29:18.630
[Breakfast]

29:16.950 --> 29:18.720
Our Ma family's braised meat

29:18.740 --> 29:21.260
is a secret recipe passed down through generations.

29:21.260 --> 29:22.470
Do you really want to learn it?

29:22.490 --> 29:23.230
I do.

29:23.250 --> 29:24.970
Then you'll have to marry into our family first.

29:26.170 --> 29:27.400
Then I'll learn it too.

29:27.590 --> 29:28.480
Really?

29:28.500 --> 29:31.790
I've loved Granny's braised meat since I was little.

29:31.810 --> 29:32.810
Once I've learned it,

29:32.870 --> 29:34.780
I won't starve wherever I go.

29:36.890 --> 29:38.030
Got it.

29:38.030 --> 29:39.740
Well, you better work hard then.

29:45.010 --> 29:45.560
Cash.

29:45.580 --> 29:46.280
Cash.

29:46.300 --> 29:46.890
Cash.

29:46.910 --> 29:47.550
Cash.

29:49.450 --> 29:50.060
Cage.

29:50.090 --> 29:50.730
Cage.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.690
Cage.

29:52.490 --> 29:53.120
Captain.

29:53.150 --> 29:53.790
Captain.

29:53.820 --> 29:54.340
Captain.

29:54.910 --> 29:55.800
Cage.

29:55.880 --> 29:57.430
Check. Check. Check.

29:57.450 --> 29:58.870
Captain.

29:59.060 --> 30:00.620
Check. Check.

30:08.260 --> 30:09.930
It's really English, huh?

30:11.480 --> 30:13.640
I don't see pigs flying.

30:13.680 --> 30:15.760
Xie Wanghe is actually studying hard.

30:16.100 --> 30:17.660
English is important, okay?

30:18.660 --> 30:20.750
Nowadays, top talents in Beijing and Shanghai

30:20.750 --> 30:21.670
all speak English.

30:22.040 --> 30:24.130
So I must learn English well.

30:24.380 --> 30:25.310
Otherwise, when the time comes,

30:25.310 --> 30:27.110
I won't even be able to understand financial statements.

30:27.280 --> 30:28.890
If I go out to raise funds and meet a foreigner,

30:28.910 --> 30:30.550
I won't even last one round.

30:30.570 --> 30:31.750
How can I fool them then?

30:37.050 --> 30:38.620
If you really think like that,

30:38.660 --> 30:41.070
you might as well work on other subjects too.

30:41.090 --> 30:42.910
And while you're at it, get yourself into a Project 985 university.

30:53.510 --> 30:54.990
Hey, are you really serious?

30:55.020 --> 30:56.520
Don't joke with me.

30:56.570 --> 30:57.770
What do you mean?

30:58.480 --> 31:00.010
Don't you want me to get into college?

31:01.610 --> 31:02.350
No, it's not that.

31:03.610 --> 31:05.470
But this is too sudden, isn't it?

31:05.960 --> 31:06.970
How did you come to this decision?

31:16.090 --> 31:17.400
It's just that one day,

31:18.320 --> 31:20.640
you'd suddenly realize that besides studying,

31:21.740 --> 31:22.910
there's nothing else you can do.

31:34.120 --> 31:35.600
Mr. Xu is also to blame.

31:36.580 --> 31:39.740
During the home visit, he went so far saying good things about me.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.200
He gave my parents hope.

31:42.690 --> 31:43.440
Anyway,

31:44.160 --> 31:45.410
I'll give it my all and go for it.

31:46.450 --> 31:47.810
I must get into college.

31:48.470 --> 31:49.190
Otherwise,

31:49.220 --> 31:51.280
I'll have to see my dad sulking at home all day.

31:51.390 --> 31:52.480
It breaks my heart.

31:55.190 --> 31:56.110
Fenghua,

31:56.690 --> 31:57.800
why don't you give it a shot too?

31:58.690 --> 32:00.850
By then, we'll all be admitted to universities in Beijing,

32:01.050 --> 32:02.650
and you'll be the only one left at home.

32:03.110 --> 32:04.450
Won't you feel embarrassed?

32:08.170 --> 32:09.980
As if you could really get in.

32:11.720 --> 32:13.450
What if I do get in?

32:20.320 --> 32:21.310
If you get in,

32:21.340 --> 32:22.960
I'll set up a breakfast stand at your school gate.

32:22.960 --> 32:24.590
I'll tell everyone I meet that I was your first love,

32:24.630 --> 32:25.870
and I was abandoned by you.

32:25.870 --> 32:28.280
My girlfriend wouldn't lisp.

32:44.240 --> 32:55.010
[Yunqi Driving School]

32:55.010 --> 32:56.550
[Registration Hall]

33:01.060 --> 33:04.440
[Registration Hall]

33:05.890 --> 33:11.050
[Yunqi Driving School Coach Truck]

33:09.020 --> 33:10.800
Coach, here's the list of trainees.

33:11.130 --> 33:11.680
Okay.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.700
Hello, trainees.

33:14.730 --> 33:16.410
Hello, coach.

33:17.300 --> 33:18.510
The car training is over there.

33:19.800 --> 33:20.970
I'm here for truck training.

33:21.030 --> 33:22.350
You... You're here for truck training?

33:23.460 --> 33:24.260
You?

33:24.710 --> 33:25.190
She's here for truck training.

33:25.210 --> 33:25.850
Are you serious?

33:26.480 --> 33:27.680
What's wrong?

33:27.710 --> 33:29.510
Can't women learn to drive a truck?

33:30.020 --> 33:31.330
You might not know this,

33:31.350 --> 33:33.660
but a truck runs thousands of kilometers on the highway,

33:33.680 --> 33:35.120
and it requires two people to take shifts driving.

33:35.320 --> 33:37.160
Are there other women to switch shifts with you?

33:38.610 --> 33:40.340
If there's no other woman switching shifts with me,

33:40.490 --> 33:42.640
I can switch shifts with men, right?

33:43.950 --> 33:44.580
Coach, coach.

33:44.630 --> 33:45.570
I'll do it.

33:46.080 --> 33:48.110
I love driving at night.

33:48.150 --> 33:49.470
Don't trust him. He's just a lecher.

33:49.500 --> 33:50.480
What's all this fuss about?

33:50.510 --> 33:51.670
Stop it.

33:52.900 --> 33:53.870
Besides taking shifts driving,

33:53.900 --> 33:56.600
sometimes you'll also have to load and unload cargo. Can you handle that?

33:57.610 --> 33:58.450
I can.

33:59.100 --> 33:59.790
If others can do it,

33:59.790 --> 34:00.590
I can do it too.

34:00.760 --> 34:02.910
At home, I can carry

34:02.930 --> 34:03.720
50-catty bags of rice by myself.

34:03.760 --> 34:04.740
I can do it.

34:04.760 --> 34:06.260
There's no point in bluffing.

34:06.340 --> 34:07.210
Get in the truck.

34:07.390 --> 34:08.429
Try it.

34:08.750 --> 34:09.510
Give it a try. Show me.

34:09.530 --> 34:11.560
Come on, show me if you can do it.

34:14.389 --> 34:16.010
She probably can't even open the door.

34:23.760 --> 34:24.570
Take it easy.

34:24.600 --> 34:25.510
Be careful.

34:25.489 --> 34:27.790
[Yunqi Driving School Coach Truck]

34:27.550 --> 34:28.780
Alright, alright.

34:29.989 --> 34:31.280
You'd better go home already.

34:31.300 --> 34:32.889
Don't waste your money.

34:33.139 --> 34:35.420
You might as well go home and knit sweaters instead.

34:42.199 --> 34:43.980
It's like the truck's self-driving.

34:44.020 --> 34:45.230
In the future, on the highway,

34:45.230 --> 34:47.000
her overtaking a car would scare people to death.

34:49.230 --> 34:50.440
Have you made up your mind?

34:50.670 --> 34:51.840
Once the training starts,

34:51.860 --> 34:52.920
the tuition fee is non-refundable.

34:52.949 --> 34:54.630
This isn't a job for women.

34:54.659 --> 34:56.080
That's right.

34:56.110 --> 34:57.190
Just go home.

34:58.790 --> 34:59.930
Don't honk it randomly.

35:00.010 --> 35:01.420
Do you even know how to drive?

35:01.720 --> 35:02.920
Want to make a bet?

35:03.040 --> 35:05.050
I'll be the first one here to get the license.

35:05.080 --> 35:06.100
Are you in or not?

35:07.480 --> 35:08.760
I'll bet with you.

35:08.790 --> 35:09.990
If you get the license,

35:10.010 --> 35:11.990
each of us will give you ten yuan.

35:12.010 --> 35:13.340
If you can't get the license,

35:13.370 --> 35:15.360
you give each of us ten yuan.

35:15.460 --> 35:16.480
How does that sound?

35:16.590 --> 35:17.990
Great!

35:18.020 --> 35:19.310
Great! Great!

35:19.860 --> 35:21.070
It's a bet!

35:23.140 --> 35:23.900
Where do I press?

35:24.970 --> 35:25.780
Furthermore,

35:25.810 --> 35:27.740
through the general term formula of this geometric sequence,

35:27.760 --> 35:28.970
what can we derive?

35:29.010 --> 35:30.690
This equals this,

35:30.710 --> 35:31.560
right?

35:31.590 --> 35:32.590
Alright, class dismissed.

35:32.670 --> 35:33.360
Stand up!

35:32.720 --> 35:35.700
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

35:33.950 --> 35:35.460
Wait, wait.

35:35.790 --> 35:37.450
I have a few more words to say to you.

35:38.390 --> 35:39.380
Last time,

35:39.680 --> 35:42.090
your classmate, Xie Wanghe, mentioned in class

35:42.130 --> 35:43.260
about test prepping.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.830
I've discussed it with the principal,

35:44.870 --> 35:46.090
and we think it's a great idea.

35:46.120 --> 35:48.890
We've decided to use our class as a pilot.

35:49.020 --> 35:51.860
We'll organize test prep sessions during the evening self-study time.

35:53.240 --> 35:55.570
The test papers are being prepared.

35:55.810 --> 35:56.890
Please look forward to it.

35:56.790 --> 35:58.850
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

36:02.280 --> 36:04.630
If it proves effective,

36:03.550 --> 36:07.290
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

36:05.030 --> 36:07.350
we'll promote it throughout the entire school.

36:07.540 --> 36:09.540
If it really works as Xie Wanghe said

36:09.560 --> 36:12.200
and can quickly improve your performance,

36:12.630 --> 36:13.540
Xie Wanghe,

36:13.950 --> 36:14.940
you will

36:14.990 --> 36:17.080
be a hero to them.

36:19.870 --> 36:20.500
Alright, alright.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.070
Class dismissed.

36:21.070 --> 36:21.840
Stand up!

36:21.930 --> 36:24.790
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

36:23.630 --> 36:26.430
Goodbye, teacher.

36:27.580 --> 36:30.110
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

36:29.580 --> 36:30.170
Nice.

36:30.190 --> 36:32.490
Now we know what it means to shoot ourselves in the foot.

36:33.540 --> 36:34.350
Wanghe.

36:34.410 --> 36:35.750
Actually, you could

36:35.830 --> 36:36.990
continue working on the intelligent question bank after our college entrance exam.

36:36.990 --> 36:38.300
I can't think that much right now.

36:38.300 --> 36:39.630
I can't focus on two things at once.

36:39.650 --> 36:40.970
The top priority now is that

36:41.010 --> 36:42.570
I have to catch up on the coursework

36:42.580 --> 36:43.790
I missed in the first two years.

36:44.150 --> 36:46.020
No matter what, I can't get lower grades than Xiaopang, right?

36:47.070 --> 36:48.340
Give it a rest.

36:48.590 --> 36:49.980
I could score higher than you with my eyes closed.

36:50.020 --> 36:50.860
Not necessarily.

36:50.890 --> 36:52.840
Wanghe got full marks on that function word problem yesterday,

36:52.880 --> 36:54.140
while you failed to answer it.

36:54.170 --> 36:55.050
Seriously?

36:55.080 --> 36:56.200
Of course.

36:55.230 --> 36:57.580
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

36:56.230 --> 36:57.070
Let's go eat.

36:57.110 --> 36:58.670
Fenghua, aren't you coming to eat with us?

37:05.640 --> 37:12.270
[Breakfast]

37:05.940 --> 37:06.760
Young lady.

37:06.960 --> 37:08.590
Come on, have a bowl of tofu pudding.

37:14.660 --> 37:15.500
Yuling.

37:15.540 --> 37:17.270
What do you think Fenghua

37:17.350 --> 37:18.710
can do after graduating from high school?

37:18.710 --> 37:19.830
She won't be able to get into college.

37:20.070 --> 37:21.020
I'm so worried.

37:22.250 --> 37:23.530
She can do anything.

37:23.550 --> 37:24.570
But no matter what,

37:24.850 --> 37:26.010
we can't let her set up a stall like we do.

37:26.050 --> 37:26.900
That's for sure.

37:27.430 --> 37:29.870
If she starts setting up a stall like us at such a young age,

37:29.900 --> 37:31.380
her life will be ruined.

37:33.120 --> 37:34.390
Yan!

37:34.420 --> 37:36.230
[Breakfast]

37:35.020 --> 37:37.690
Yan! Yan!

37:38.160 --> 37:38.720
Let's go.

37:38.760 --> 37:39.320
Mom.

37:40.590 --> 37:41.710
Why are you here?

37:41.750 --> 37:43.140
Why can't I come?

37:43.180 --> 37:44.600
I miss my son.

37:44.760 --> 37:45.600
Is there any soy milk?

37:45.630 --> 37:46.390
My mouth is dry.

37:46.870 --> 37:47.910
Mom is thirsty.

37:56.270 --> 37:57.570
We'll need another bowl here.

38:05.620 --> 38:06.870
Don't take others' food like that.

38:06.870 --> 38:07.870
You have to pay for it.

38:07.870 --> 38:08.950
It wasn't made by me.

38:08.950 --> 38:10.430
Why don't you just pay for it?

38:10.590 --> 38:11.550
We're all family.

38:11.550 --> 38:12.620
Why do we have to stand on ceremony?

38:13.470 --> 38:14.380
Eat more.

38:14.470 --> 38:15.180
It's okay.

38:21.940 --> 38:23.510
Haikuo, I'm going over to your house for dinner tonight.

38:23.590 --> 38:25.390
Sure, but bring your own dishes.

38:25.390 --> 38:27.080
Why are you so stingy?

38:27.110 --> 38:27.720
Okay.

38:27.740 --> 38:28.770
I was just kidding.

38:29.280 --> 38:32.780
The last one to arrive buys drinks.

38:33.470 --> 38:34.350
Xia Fenghua.

38:43.090 --> 38:44.300
How dare you come again?

38:44.380 --> 38:45.610
You've got some nerve.

38:45.630 --> 38:46.380
It's him?

38:46.400 --> 38:47.420
Can we talk?

38:47.500 --> 38:49.030
What's there to talk about with you?

38:49.080 --> 38:51.620
I'll let it slide that you got physical with me.

38:52.260 --> 38:54.800
But she must pay back the 10,000 yuan she took from me.

38:55.740 --> 38:57.050
What if we refuse?

38:59.010 --> 38:59.940
You're students.

38:59.980 --> 39:01.440
Your main task is to study.

39:01.740 --> 39:02.960
Don't make trouble for yourselves.

39:03.550 --> 39:04.390
Trying to frighten me?

39:05.690 --> 39:07.860
You did such filthy things,

39:07.890 --> 39:08.950
and you still have the guts to come ask for money?

39:08.990 --> 39:10.150
How can you be so shameless?

39:12.390 --> 39:13.430
So you're not paying back, huh?

39:15.950 --> 39:17.570
She'll be expecting a summons then.

39:18.300 --> 39:19.260
What summons?

39:20.680 --> 39:21.420
For breach of contract.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.710
It's not just that 10,000 yuan.

39:23.750 --> 39:25.420
You also owe me 50,000 in liquidated damages.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.550
50,000? Are you insane?

39:28.390 --> 39:29.690
Then go ahead and sue.

39:30.550 --> 39:32.330
Don't you know

39:32.350 --> 39:33.470
what you've done?

39:34.090 --> 39:35.190
What have I done?

39:35.720 --> 39:38.600
I merely had students model for advertisements.

39:38.670 --> 39:39.870
That's not illegal.

39:39.910 --> 39:42.100
It's not up to you to decide whether it's illegal or not.

39:42.220 --> 39:43.270
By the way,

39:43.870 --> 39:45.990
we've already taken screenshots of that album of yours.

39:46.020 --> 39:47.500
We'll hand them over to the Public Security Bureau

39:47.520 --> 39:49.880
and let them decide whether what you did is illegal or not.

39:50.420 --> 39:51.260
What album?

39:51.320 --> 39:52.630
What nonsense are you talking about?

39:52.860 --> 39:54.040
Are you legally illiterate?

39:54.300 --> 39:55.460
It's called lingerie advertising.

39:55.510 --> 39:56.310
It's legal.

39:56.330 --> 39:57.460
Is that so?

39:57.780 --> 39:58.260
Alright.

39:58.290 --> 40:00.880
I guess I'll see you in the newspapers then.

40:00.900 --> 40:02.480
I've even thought of a headline for you.

40:03.360 --> 40:04.490
"Minors

40:04.550 --> 40:07.270
Coerced by Unscrupulous Photographer to Take Indecent Photos,

40:07.300 --> 40:08.510
Tearfully Forced to Have Drinks with Adults."

40:08.530 --> 40:10.210
What a sensational news story.

40:10.240 --> 40:11.290
Local portal websites,

40:11.320 --> 40:12.110
photography sites,

40:12.110 --> 40:12.950
advertising sites,

40:12.990 --> 40:14.310
and any site related to your business,

40:14.310 --> 40:15.030
I'll make sure

40:15.030 --> 40:16.030
every single one of them sees the news.

40:16.030 --> 40:17.430
Let's see how you'll manage after that.

40:17.750 --> 40:18.670
Don't you dare!

40:18.760 --> 40:19.930
You started this,

40:20.190 --> 40:21.270
and I'll finish it.

40:21.710 --> 40:22.460
We're students.

40:22.550 --> 40:23.830
We have nothing to lose.

40:23.830 --> 40:25.270
Try it if you dare,

40:25.270 --> 40:25.980
and see if we dare.

40:25.980 --> 40:27.310
Let's see who has more to lose.

40:27.340 --> 40:28.500
I'm warning you.

40:28.670 --> 40:30.150
If you dare to bully Xia Fenghua again,

40:30.190 --> 40:31.960
I'll beat you up every time I see you.

40:34.110 --> 40:34.670
Let's go.

40:41.050 --> 40:42.540
Next time, it'll be the three of us who beat you up.

40:53.690 --> 40:54.570
What's wrong?

40:54.810 --> 40:56.190
You confronted him like that.

40:56.220 --> 40:57.150
Are we going to be okay?

40:57.780 --> 40:58.630
As I said,

40:58.830 --> 41:00.560
we've got nothing to lose.

41:01.040 --> 41:02.210
But I'm scared.

41:02.610 --> 41:03.580
Don't worry.

41:03.670 --> 41:05.850
They wouldn't risk losing their business over 10,000 yuan.

41:06.450 --> 41:08.190
Anyone with half a brain wouldn't do that.

41:08.220 --> 41:09.930
I'm just worried they might do something desperate.

41:10.150 --> 41:11.150
What could they possibly do?

41:11.530 --> 41:12.810
Ambush us?

41:12.830 --> 41:14.270
Rob us? Kidnap us?

41:14.310 --> 41:15.370
They wouldn't dare.

41:17.970 --> 41:18.640
Fenghua.

41:19.780 --> 41:20.940
Remember this.

41:21.810 --> 41:23.140
Except for the three of us,

41:23.410 --> 41:24.690
no one can bully you.

41:25.180 --> 41:26.670
If anyone dares to bully you,

41:26.690 --> 41:27.460
we'll take him down.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.440
We'll destroy him!

41:28.630 --> 41:29.850
We'll pour tar on his head

41:29.870 --> 41:30.890
and pluck out all his hair.

41:33.280 --> 41:35.030
What, are you preparing a roast suckling pig?

41:40.700 --> 41:41.450
Let's go home.

41:49.850 --> 41:50.650
You eat.

41:50.700 --> 41:51.670
Eat.

41:51.670 --> 41:52.390
I'll eat it then.

41:52.390 --> 41:52.990
Eat up.

41:53.390 --> 41:57.350
♫At moonset cry the crows♫

41:53.610 --> 41:54.330
Don't be stubborn.

41:54.360 --> 41:55.830
Just do as I say.

41:57.900 --> 42:00.690
How much do you think she makes in a day?

42:01.070 --> 42:02.230
Who cares how much money she makes?

42:02.230 --> 42:03.950
As long as she treats Fenghua's father well.

42:04.390 --> 42:08.120
♫Streaking the frosty sky♫

42:04.970 --> 42:06.910
Granny, Auntie.

42:07.300 --> 42:08.470
When did you arrive?

42:09.200 --> 42:10.280
We just got here.

42:10.770 --> 42:11.830
Fenghua.

42:11.920 --> 42:14.200
It's only been a few years since we last saw you,

42:14.220 --> 42:15.860
and you've grown so much.

42:15.870 --> 42:17.700
Girls really do change a lot as they grow up.

42:16.130 --> 42:19.630
♫Dimly lit fishing boats♫

42:17.720 --> 42:19.470
I remember back then, Sister-in-law, your daughter

42:19.470 --> 42:20.910
was only about this tall,

42:20.910 --> 42:22.150
and now she's grown so tall.

42:22.150 --> 42:23.750
She's getting uglier as she grows.

42:23.750 --> 42:25.150
Not even as good-looking as she was when she was little.

42:24.160 --> 42:30.390
♫Sadly lie beneath maples♫

42:25.150 --> 42:26.830
Back then, she still looked like a girl.

42:27.070 --> 42:27.790
But now,

42:27.790 --> 42:28.590
look at her.

42:28.830 --> 42:30.630
What did she do to her teeth?

42:30.910 --> 42:32.320
She's doing great, okay?

42:32.320 --> 42:34.390
Just the other day, someone invited her to shoot a commercial.

42:34.390 --> 42:36.590
They even wanted to sign her as a model.

42:36.630 --> 42:38.080
Her, a model?

42:38.610 --> 42:40.030
She even shoot a commercial?

42:40.190 --> 42:41.300
What kind of commercial?

42:41.320 --> 42:42.100
Pig feed?

42:42.100 --> 42:43.590
Mom, where's Dad?

42:43.170 --> 42:47.010
♫Beyond the city wall♫

42:44.470 --> 42:45.390
He left early this morning.

42:45.670 --> 42:46.580
Do you need something?

42:48.770 --> 42:49.940
What are they doing here?

42:49.980 --> 42:51.360
What else? Of course for money.

42:51.700 --> 42:58.070
♫From Temple of Cold Hill♫

42:51.890 --> 42:53.380
They called last time,

42:53.480 --> 42:55.350
saying the village was going to build two-story houses,

42:55.350 --> 42:56.440
all part of a unified plan.

42:56.510 --> 42:57.960
Just different ways to trick me out of my money.

42:59.220 --> 43:00.430
Who's that child?

43:00.610 --> 43:02.450
Who cares? It doesn't matter.

43:02.590 --> 43:04.840
I'm not giving them a single penny this time.

43:03.630 --> 43:09.470
♫The sound of bells in the midnight♫

43:04.870 --> 43:06.270
If they really push me too far,

43:06.270 --> 43:07.640
I'll flip the table on them.
